  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Local Infrastructure Support Programme (CDEL) - Support for Karnali Pilot and Transition Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Local Infrastructure Services Programme (LISP) will improve the ability of Nepal&#x2019;s local and provincial governments to respond to the demands of rural citizens for local infrastructure and it increase the legitimacy and accountability of local government to their citizens with an emphasis on the empowerment of women. It will create green recovery jobs to stimulate the local economy and build climate resilience. LISP will do this by providing technical assistance and performance-based funding for local infrastructure and using government systems.</narrative>
  </description>
